<P><CENTER><U><FONT SIZE="+2" FACE="Comic Sans MS"><IMG
SRC="../Images/Caumont_blason.gif" WIDTH=70 HEIGHT=83
ALIGN=middle></FONT></U><FONT SIZE="+2" FACE="Comic Sans MS">
